steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/5ff2a86aa2fd3668fe3522c6f0d3b54c.avif?t=1705740971\" width=600 height=132 /></span><br><strong>Ver.1.0.7 update's details</strong><br>-Added a new skin &quot;Halloween Dress&quot;.<br>-Reduced downward hit collision during a jump.<br>-Fixed a problem with synchronizing save data.<br>-Other minor adjustments were made.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/350b79ab759b8e99fff5de6a4eaea493.avif?t=1705740971\" width=600 height=133 /></span><br><strong>Ver.1.0.6 update's details</strong><br>-Even you quit the game, your Blood Points will save automatically.<br>-The invincible time, when you use skill \u201cSummon Zasha\u201d now extended.<br>-BGM for each area has been updated.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.5 update's details</strong><br>-Added support for German and French.<br>-Fixed auto-save while stage changing .<br>-Fixed a bug related to the behavior of enemy during stun.<br>-Updated some effects.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/6b9a6ddde2d8ef5cbe42e0d0f3aa9ce3.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" width=600 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/6b9a6ddde2d8ef5cbe42e0d0f3aa9ce3.webm?t=1705740971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.4 update's details</strong><br>-Added &quot;Death Log&quot; function to the option.<br>-Updated some BGM.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/92b0c70493b4f13e887beb887dd4a21e.avif?t=1705740971\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.3 update's details</strong><br>-Added new skin &quot;Santa Dress&quot;.<br>-Added support for Spanish (Latin America).<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9a82081a8b89060b0dd7c09a21cf5abe.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9a82081a8b89060b0dd7c09a21cf5abe.webm?t=1705740971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.2 update's details</strong><br>-Added new skin &quot;Uni Akatsuki&quot;.<br>-Added support for Korean language.<br>-Adjusted the difficulty of stage 3-6.<br>-Fixed minor bugs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/b35d45079476fa63e363e9b23e0d87a0.apng?t=1705740971\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/b35d45079476fa63e363e9b23e0d87a0.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=96 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Ver.1.0.1 update's details</strong><br>-Fixed the problem that save data may not be synchronized correctly, during offline operation.<br>-Fixed an issue that effects were not correctly show in high fps output while stage clear.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>It is cute but extremely hard!!!<br>The immortal girl keeps to be reborn any number of times even if she gets beaten.<br>It is an action game that includes puzzle-like elements by learning the movement and timing of the enemies.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1186270/extras/9b413ebaade2717021088ac1e5205f41.poster.avif?t=1705740971\" width=600 heigh